Subject: [BioC] LIMMA similarity of contrast matrix, F test and topTable
In-Reply-To: <ACA7A240-B97D-4882-80A0-0ADCC336C67C@gmail.com>
References: <ACA7A240-B97D-4882-80A0-0ADCC336C67C@gmail.com>
