Dear Suresh Dara,

Do you mean that you have a gene expression data set and you want to 
normalize it?

There is a different normalization strategy for every different gene 
expression technology.  You need to identify what sort of data you are 
working on, and then start by reading the Bioconductor documentation 
associated with that technology.

One way to start would be through the BiocViews page:

  http://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/BiocViews.html

which associates software packages that do normalization and which work 
with specific technology platforms.

Best wishes
Gordon

