Dear Quynh,

Please let me know which version of ROOT you did install, i.e. the file 
that you have downloaded.

As far as I see you are running Mac OS X 10.8.0. Did you install the 
binary version of xps for Snow Leopard?

In this case you need to install root_v5.34.05, since this is the 
version used by BioC to create the xps binary. You can download this 
version of root from:
ftp://root.cern.ch/root/root_v5.34.05.macosx64-10.8-i386.tar.gz

Best regards,
Christian



